              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwenilu lwakekali chidika chenu chahaya nyaka chakwilaŋa mukakwejika muchitanu nachiyedi, hefuku damwikumi dakakweji, mwakadi kabishaŋa munyichima yenu, kukopelamu mudimu nehi, hela mwenimbuhela mwenyi mwashakama nindi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
