              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheni chichakekali chidika chenu chahaya nyaka, chakwilaŋa yakubuta nachu anyana kaIsarela hansaŋu yanshidi jawu, kamu hohu hamwaka. Welili mwomwa mulejelu wuMosi kudi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
